 "quests": [
  {
   "copper": 18,
   "description": "A fox at the door is a question the forest cannot answer. Poachers have emptied the hunting grounds, and Bracken Foxes now trouble our homes; cull eight by day in the Starbough Lower Boughs, which lie in the south of Starbough Vale. I can ask you to quiet the hunger here, but we must still find who caused it.",
   "giver": "r14_elf_steward",
   "giver_name": "Ilyra Mossveil",
   "giver_settlement": "Starbough Village",
   "id": "starbough_boughs_01",
   "min_level": 10,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 8 young_fox [in elandor_starbough_vale/lower_boughs]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "elandor_starbough_vale/lower_boughs",
     "count": 8,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:young_fox"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "silverleaf_departure"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Hunger Beneath the Boughs",
   "turnin": "r14_elf_steward",
   "xp": 280
  },
  {
   "copper": 10,
   "description": "Our oldest trees still bear their tending marks, though mine have begun to look like sneezes. By day, Bracken Foxes roam the Starbough Lower Boughs, which lie in the south of Starbough Vale; bring me two Brush Fox Tails from them so I can replace my brushes. If Ilyra sends you hunting there, attend to both tasks together; no tree grows faster because we walk past it twice.",
   "giver": "r15_elf_local",
   "giver_name": "Lethri Reedshade",
   "giver_settlement": "Starbough Village",
   "id": "starbough_stores_01",
   "min_level": 10,
   "objectives": [
    "bring 2 grug_mobs:brush_fox_tail"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "count": 2,
     "item": "grug_mobs:brush_fox_tail",
     "type": "item"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "silverleaf_departure"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Marks Worth Renewing",
   "turnin": "r15_elf_local",
   "xp": 160
  },
  {
   "copper": 18,
   "description": "The seed we set aside must last until the thaw, and Granary Rats have no respect for that agreement. Kill eight after dark in the Starbough Lower Boughs, before their burrows reach our stores. Choose your fights carefully: their squeals invite company.",
   "giver": "r14_elf_steward",
   "giver_name": "Ilyra Mossveil",
   "giver_settlement": "Starbough Village",
   "id": "starbough_boughs_02",
   "min_level": 11,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 8 granary_rat [in elandor_starbough_vale/lower_boughs]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "elandor_starbough_vale/lower_boughs",
     "count": 8,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:granary_rat"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "starbough_boughs_01"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Winter Has Enough Mouths",
   "turnin": "r14_elf_steward",
   "xp": 298
  },
  {
   "copper": 18,
   "description": "Every wire beside the drinking places bears the same knot, tied as neatly as a gardener's binding. Defeat five Snaring Poachers at night in the Starbough Lower Boughs; they are scattered, so give the search time. Someone taught those hands, and I intend to learn the teacher's name.",
   "giver": "r14_elf_steward",
   "giver_name": "Ilyra Mossveil",
   "giver_settlement": "Starbough Village",
   "id": "starbough_boughs_03",
   "min_level": 12,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 5 snaring_poacher [in elandor_starbough_vale/lower_boughs]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "elandor_starbough_vale/lower_boughs",
     "count": 5,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:snaring_poacher"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "starbough_boughs_02"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "One Knot, Many Hands",
   "turnin": "r14_elf_steward",
   "xp": 315
  },
  {
   "copper": 16,
   "description": "I trust a living branch to bend; a neglected brace is another matter. Bring me six Iron Bars and four Coal Lumps for the walkway repairs, using the vale's rock for ore if you need it. Check your pick before mining: admiring a seam has yet to put metal on my workbench.",
   "giver": "r15_elf_local",
   "giver_name": "Lethri Reedshade",
   "giver_settlement": "Starbough Village",
   "id": "starbough_stores_02",
   "min_level": 12,
   "objectives": [
    "bring 6 grug_materials:iron_bar",
    "bring 4 default:coal_lump"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "count": 6,
     "item": "grug_materials:iron_bar",
     "type": "item"
    },
    {
     "count": 4,
     "item": "default:coal_lump",
     "type": "item"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "starbough_stores_01"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Trust the Branch, Check the Brace",
   "turnin": "r15_elf_local",
   "xp": 270
  },
  {
   "copper": 5,
   "description": "Theren Farstep at Starbough Outpost can read a bent fern as readily as I read a letter. Follow the vale road to him and describe the poachers' knot; his watch may have seen where the wires lead. Tell him I read his last report in full, including the remarks about my handwriting.",
   "giver": "r14_elf_steward",
   "giver_name": "Ilyra Mossveil",
   "giver_settlement": "Starbough Village",
   "id": "starbough_boughs_04",
   "min_level": 13,
   "objectives": [
    "talk to Theren Farstep (starbough_outpost)"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
