   "title": "When the Underbrush Answers",
   "turnin": "r14_elf_scout",
   "xp": 400
  },
  {
   "copper": 21,
   "description": "Burrow Gnawers chew through the poachers' wires, then our bootlaces, without the slightest sense of allegiance. Kill seven after nightfall in the Starbough Greenwood, which lies in the heart of Starbough Vale. Watch for Cairn Zombies on the same ground; I would like this patrol to return breathing.",
   "giver": "r14_elf_scout",
   "giver_name": "Theren Farstep",
   "giver_settlement": "Starbough Outpost",
