  {
   "copper": 16,
   "description": "I have learned quite enough here to make these people nervous, and I would rather not recite it within bowshot. Defeat four Bandit Lookouts at the Starbough Bandit Camp nearby, by day or night. Close the distance before their arrows settle the conversation, then return to me.",
