   "description": "Another bandit always seems eager to inherit a patch of stolen ground. Defeat six Roadside Bandits at the Starbough Bandit Camp nearby, by day or night, and return to me for Starbough's payment. You may take the bounty again; I have plenty of patience for making their trade unprofitable.",
