  {
   "copper": 21,
   "description": "Vetch sells the snares, and he works the Starbough High Boughs, which lie in the northwest of Starbough Vale, on ground that discourages questions. Cull eight Ridgeback Tuskers there by day. You will have fewer tusks to contend with when you go looking for him.",
