  {
   "copper": 10,
   "description": "I repair the root braces; the Burrow Gnawers return to inspect my work with their teeth. Kill eight at night in the Starbough High Boughs, which lie in the northwest of Starbough Vale, and report back for payment. This is a standing bounty, since neither the trees nor I can afford to retire.",
