  {
   "copper": 26,
   "description": "I watched Poacher Snarekeeper Vetch tie that knot so often I could do it with my eyes shut. Find him northwest from here, by day or night, and defeat him. Let the next hands that learn the pattern use it to support a sapling.",
   "giver": "r14_elf_captive",
